1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:01,253
Ah... ah...

2
00:00:01,253 --> 00:00:01,931
ACHOO!

3
00:00:02,481 --> 00:00:03,562
Who sneezed?

4
00:00:03,562 --> 00:00:04,788
Can you guess?

5
00:00:06,788 --> 00:00:08,261
It was you, Pip!

6
00:00:08,261 --> 00:00:09,269
Bless you!

7
00:00:09,819 --> 00:00:12,376
Brrr! Is it hot or cold today?

8
00:00:14,376 --> 00:00:17,191
Cold! It's the first chilly day!

9
00:00:19,041 --> 00:00:20,493
My nose is cold.

10
00:00:20,493 --> 00:00:22,022
My ears are cold.

11
00:00:22,272 --> 00:00:24,887
Even my waggy tail is cold!

12
00:00:25,437 --> 00:00:26,312
Oh, Pip!

13
00:00:26,312 --> 00:00:29,491
You need a cosy hat and a warm scarf.

14
00:00:29,741 --> 00:00:31,658
Come inside!

15
00:00:33,508 --> 00:00:34,607
I found a hat!

16
00:00:34,607 --> 00:00:36,739
Hey... who turned off the sun?

17
00:00:37,289 --> 00:00:38,094
Hee hee!

18
00:00:38,094 --> 00:00:40,655
Pip, that's Mama's big, big hat!

19
00:00:41,205 --> 00:00:42,140
Where's Pip?

20
00:00:42,140 --> 00:00:43,263
Can you see me?

21
00:00:46,163 --> 00:00:48,105
Peekaboo! Here I am!

22
00:00:48,655 --> 00:00:51,810
That hat is too big for a little puppy.

23
00:00:52,060 --> 00:00:55,167
Let's find your very own cosy things!

24
00:00:57,017 --> 00:00:58,041
Look, a hat!

25
00:00:58,041 --> 00:00:59,748
What colour is my hat?

26
00:01:01,748 --> 00:01:05,036
Red! A red hat with a fluffy white pompom!

27
00:01:06,886 --> 00:01:08,723
And here's a long scarf.

28
00:01:08,723 --> 00:01:10,627
What colour is the scarf?

29
00:01:12,627 --> 00:01:15,284
Blue! Blue with white stripes.

30
00:01:15,534 --> 00:01:17,443
Wrap, wrap, wrap!

31
00:01:19,293 --> 00:01:20,396
Now, mittens!

32
00:01:20,396 --> 00:01:22,740
How many mittens can you count?

33
00:01:24,740 --> 00:01:25,449
One, two!

34
00:01:25,449 --> 00:01:26,750
Two yellow mittens,

35
00:01:26,750 --> 00:01:27,932
one for each paw!

36
00:01:29,782 --> 00:01:32,859
Red hat, blue scarf, yellow mittens.

37
00:01:33,109 --> 00:01:35,205
Ta-da! I'm cosy now!

38
00:01:35,755 --> 00:01:38,409
Can you put on a pretend hat?

39
00:01:38,659 --> 00:01:41,140
Pull it down over your ears!

40
00:01:43,140 --> 00:01:45,561
Let's go play outside!

41
00:01:47,411 --> 00:01:50,200
Uh-oh. My nose is tickly again.

42
00:01:50,450 --> 00:01:51,777
Ah... ah...

43
00:01:52,327 --> 00:01:53,316
Wait, Pip!

44
00:01:53,316 --> 00:01:54,686
When we sneeze,

45
00:01:54,686 --> 00:01:56,817
we sneeze into our elbow.

46
00:01:57,367 --> 00:01:58,178
My elbow?

47
00:01:58,178 --> 00:01:59,598
Where is my elbow?

48
00:02:00,148 --> 00:02:03,594
It's the bendy part in the middle of your arm.

49
00:02:03,844 --> 00:02:06,247
Can you find your elbow?

50
00:02:09,547 --> 00:02:10,470
ACHOO!

51
00:02:11,020 --> 00:02:12,472
Into your elbow!

52
00:02:12,472 --> 00:02:13,619
Hooray, Pip!

53
00:02:14,168 --> 00:02:15,124
Well done!

54
00:02:15,124 --> 00:02:19,314
Now the tiny sneeze germs don't fly onto your friends.

55
00:02:21,164 --> 00:02:22,997
Let's practise together!

56
00:02:22,997 --> 00:02:24,491
Lift your elbow up.

57
00:02:24,741 --> 00:02:25,664
Ready?

58
00:02:27,264 --> 00:02:28,952
A teeny, tiny sneeze.

59
00:02:28,952 --> 00:02:29,514
Ah...

60
00:02:29,764 --> 00:02:30,572
choo!

61
00:02:32,172 --> 00:02:34,040
Now a big, silly sneeze!

62
00:02:34,040 --> 00:02:34,593
Ah...

63
00:02:34,843 --> 00:02:36,077
ah... ah...

64
00:02:36,077 --> 00:02:36,871
ACHOO!

65
00:02:39,771 --> 00:02:42,440
Is your nose a little drippy?

66
00:02:42,690 --> 00:02:44,244
Use a tissue.

67
00:02:44,244 --> 00:02:45,603
Wipe, wipe.

68
00:02:46,153 --> 00:02:48,634
Then into the bin it goes.

69
00:02:48,884 --> 00:02:50,364
Bye-bye, tissue!

70
00:02:50,914 --> 00:02:51,840
And then,

71
00:02:51,840 --> 00:02:53,536
what do we do next?

72
00:02:53,786 --> 00:02:55,606
Can you guess?

73
00:02:57,606 --> 00:02:59,125
Wash our paws!

74
00:03:00,975 --> 00:03:03,533
Splish! Warm water, and soap.

75
00:03:03,783 --> 00:03:05,841
Bubbles on my paws!

76
00:03:06,391 --> 00:03:09,225
Let's scrub and count to ten.

77
00:03:09,475 --> 00:03:11,306
Count with us!

78
00:03:12,306 --> 00:03:16,325
One, two, three, four, five, six, seven, eight, nine, ten!

79
00:03:16,875 --> 00:03:19,017
Scrub the fronts, the backs,

80
00:03:19,017 --> 00:03:20,261
and in between!

81
00:03:22,111 --> 00:03:24,688
Look! Big bubbles floating up!

82
00:03:24,938 --> 00:03:27,323
How many bubbles can you see?

83
00:03:29,323 --> 00:03:30,720
One, two, three!

84
00:03:30,720 --> 00:03:32,265
Three big bubbles!

85
00:03:32,815 --> 00:03:35,157
Pop them with your finger!

86
00:03:35,407 --> 00:03:37,218
Pop, pop, pop!

87
00:03:37,618 --> 00:03:38,313
Pop! Pop!

88
00:03:38,313 --> 00:03:38,718
Pop!

89
00:03:40,418 --> 00:03:41,626
Rinse, rinse,

90
00:03:41,626 --> 00:03:43,588
and dry with the towel.

91
00:03:44,138 --> 00:03:45,725
Clean, clean paws!

92
00:03:45,725 --> 00:03:46,330
Woof!

93
00:03:48,180 --> 00:03:49,525
Hello, friends!

94
00:03:49,525 --> 00:03:50,572
Quack! Ooh,

95
00:03:50,572 --> 00:03:52,141
my beak is tickly.

96
00:03:52,391 --> 00:03:54,180
Ah... ah...

97
00:03:54,730 --> 00:03:55,673
Wait, Dotty!

98
00:03:55,673 --> 00:03:57,307
Sneeze into your elbow!

99
00:03:57,857 --> 00:03:58,667
But Pip,

100
00:03:58,667 --> 00:04:01,318
ducks don't have elbows like you!

101
00:04:01,868 --> 00:04:03,556
Hmm. What can Dotty use?

102
00:04:03,556 --> 00:04:04,618
Can you think?

103
00:04:07,918 --> 00:04:08,820
Her wing!

104
00:04:08,820 --> 00:04:11,225
Into your fluffy wing, Dotty!

105
00:04:11,775 --> 00:04:13,024
Ah... ah...

106
00:04:13,024 --> 00:04:14,987
choo! Into my wing!

107
00:04:15,237 --> 00:04:16,468
Quack!

108
00:04:17,018 --> 00:04:20,191
Hooray! Everybody can cover a sneeze!

109
00:04:22,041 --> 00:04:23,847
I'm so proud of you!

110
00:04:23,847 --> 00:04:26,282
Cosy clothes, elbow sneezes,

111
00:04:26,282 --> 00:04:27,696
and clean paws.

112
00:04:28,246 --> 00:04:29,906
And I helped Dotty, too!

113
00:04:29,906 --> 00:04:31,688
Let's sing our Achoo Song!

114
00:04:33,538 --> 00:04:34,841
Hat on my head,

115
00:04:34,841 --> 00:04:36,288
my scarf is blue.

116
00:04:36,538 --> 00:04:38,942
Two yellow mittens, I'm cosy!

117
00:04:39,192 --> 00:04:40,250
Are you?

118
00:04:41,650 --> 00:04:43,551
When my nose is tickly,

119
00:04:43,551 --> 00:04:44,721
what do I do?

120
00:04:45,271 --> 00:04:47,771
Lift my elbow, achoo, achoo!

121
00:04:50,071 --> 00:04:51,236
Achoo, achoo,

122
00:04:51,236 --> 00:04:52,474
into my elbow!

123
00:04:52,724 --> 00:04:54,357
A tissue for my nose,

124
00:04:54,357 --> 00:04:55,513
and off we go!

125
00:04:56,113 --> 00:04:57,301
Wash, wash,

126
00:04:57,301 --> 00:04:58,659
wash my paws,

127
00:04:58,659 --> 00:05:00,017
count to ten!

128
00:05:00,267 --> 00:05:03,267
Now we're cosy friends again!

129
00:05:05,567 --> 00:05:06,751
One more time!

130
00:05:06,751 --> 00:05:08,701
Lift your elbow and sing!

131
00:05:08,951 --> 00:05:10,117
Achoo, achoo,

132
00:05:10,117 --> 00:05:11,355
into my elbow!

133
00:05:12,155 --> 00:05:16,023
Share with a friend and subscribe to Honey Bunny Kidz!

134
00:05:16,623 --> 00:05:17,538
Next time,

135
00:05:17,538 --> 00:05:20,632
Lulu Lamb sees her very first snowflakes!

136
00:05:21,233 --> 00:05:22,903
Woof! Stay cosy, friends!

137
00:05:22,903 --> 00:05:25,348
See you next time on Honey Bunny Kidz!
